  "releaseNotes": "Critical Memory Layout Alignment Fix:\n      - Separated memory shifting behaviors to eliminate buffer space fragmentation.\n      - Implemented `Buffer.Unshift` for negative deltas to correctly reclaim space when payloads shrink.\n      - Preserved exact geometric mapping between the physical byte array and the internal Offset Table.\n      - Resolved nested layout shifting issues, ensuring full backward compatibility and stability across multi-level structures.",
